{"quest_id": 8609, "name": "多種多様なカニの群れ", "description": "王子たちが再び情報の整理をしていると、\nミニメカに釣られたカニの大群が現れて！？\n襲い来るカニたちを撃退せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "真夏のカオスリゾート", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920235, "map_no": 9377, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 50, "exp": 270, "gold": 1200, "drops": [{"card": 19, "c": 1}, {"card": 361, "c": 1}, {"card": 57, "c": 1}, {"item": 1007, "c": 1}, {"card": 1654, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["水棲", "機械"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1200, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 147, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2144320, "special_effect_id": 1375, "master_id": 36168, "global_id": 9785}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 25, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1500, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 228, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.0, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2119360, "race_id": 7, "master_id": 36171, "global_id": 9788, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 7000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 7000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 3000, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 228, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2119360, "race_id": 7, "master_id": 34803, "global_id": 8420, "spawn_sec": 69}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["変異"], "hp": 3000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 3000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 500, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 236, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 0.8999999761581421, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2129360, "race_id": 7, "special_effect_id": 66, "master_id": 33821, "global_id": 7438, "spawn_sec": 75}], "popups": ["変異したクラブウォーリアは\nHPが徐々に回復します。\n一定時間経過すると\n回復効果は無くなります。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ペルセナス", "text": "本当にカニの大群だー！？", "face": "u2482a1"}, {"name": "スーシェン", "text": "ミニメカに引き寄せられたと言っても限度があるかと。", "face": "u2486a1"}, {"name": "コウメ", "text": "思ったよりも大変な感じだ……。\nこれ、どうにかするんですか？", "face": "u2490a1"}, {"name": "ペルセナス", "text": "まぁ、今回の騒動の黒幕の仕業かもしれないし、\nカニには悪いけど追い払おうか！", "face": "u2482a1"}, {"name": "サクヤ", "text": "分かりました……おや？\n群れの中に、変わったカニが混ざっているような……？", "face": "u2489a1"}, {"name": "イーリス", "text": "あれは、変異クラブウォーリア……？", "face": "u1261a1"}, {"name": "アージェ", "text": "何か知っているのですか？", "face": "u2487a1"}, {"name": "イーリス", "text": "過去に交戦したことがあります。\nですが変異種がいるということは……もしかして……。", "face": "u1261a1"}, {"name": "ペルセナス", "text": "とにかく、今はカニの相手をしよう！\n色々考えるのはその後で！", "face": "u2482a1"}, {"name": "エレイン", "text": "それならあの変な色のカニ……変異種に気を付けて！\nあいつら、傷を回復する力を持ってるから！", "face": "u517"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "クロノシア", "text": "無事に追い払うことができましたが、\nこれはいったい何だったのでしょうか……？", "face": "u2484a1"}, {"name": "イヴリール", "text": "ふん、おおかた例の招待状の主が、\n自分で行動を始めたといったところだろう。", "face": "u2488a1"}, {"name": "スーシェン", "text": "何者かがカニをけしかけてきた……。\nということも、ありえるのでしょうか。", "face": "u2486a1"}, {"name": "イコル", "text": "各勢力に手紙を送りつけるような奴だ。\nこんな回りくどいことをしてもおかしくはないよ。", "face": "u2485a1"}, {"name": "イコル", "text": "まぁ、なにがしたいのかは分からないけど――", "face": "u2485a1"}, {"name": "シャチのギルマン", "text": "キュケケー！？", "face": "l57b986b108f8"}, {"name": "サクヤ", "text": "今のは……まさか、悲鳴……！？", "face": "u2489a1"}, {"name": "アージェ", "text": "リゾート施設の方向から聞こえました。\nまた揉めている、というわけではなさそうです。", "face": "u2487a1"}, {"name": "ペルセナス", "text": "きっと何かあったんだ！　急いでみんなの所に戻ろう！", "face": "u2482a1"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920235_9377", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 934, "y": 422}, {"k": "m", "x": 728, "y": 421, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 146, "y": 204, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 450, "y": 207, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 490, "y": 363, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 516, "y": 275, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 358, "y": 334, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 233, "y": 314, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 385, "y": 250, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 117, "y": 288, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 755, "y": 326, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 607, "y": 390, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 635, "y": 300, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 410, "y": 127, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 262, "y": 230, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 872, "y": 356, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 839, "y": 448, "id": 215}, {"k": "r", "x": 557, "y": 446, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 675, "y": 477, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 364, "y": 180, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 537, "y": 211, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 850, "y": 274, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 775, "y": 257, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 829, "y": 226, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 241, "y": 377, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 365, "y": 406, "id": 308}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "A Swarm of Diverse Crabs", "description_en": "As the Princes organize their information again, a massive swarm of crabs lured by the Mini-Mecha appears! Repel the attacking crabs! Advanced (★1 Target: Avg Lv10)"}